### CREATE (tambah produk)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anyaman Peci",
  "price": 17000,
  "description": "Terbuat dari daun pohon kelapa",
  "stock": 20
}

### READ (lihat semua produk)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### READ by ID (misalnya ID 1)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/1

### UPDATE (ubah produk dengan ID 1)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anyaman Peci",
  "price": 20000,
  "stock": 15
}

### DELETE (hapus produk dengan ID 1)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/products/9
